# 4. MANDATORY IMPLEMENTATION RULES (STRICT)
- Follow MASTER_PLAN_PHASES order. Final marble×JARVIS interface is Phase 5 only.
- NEVER invent contractor names, phone numbers, or placeholder leads for demos or handovers.
- NEVER seed Google Sheets with fabricated fallback arrays. An empty ledger is preferred over fake data.
- PRIMARY harvest: Google Maps + Google Search (+ public Instagram SERP cards) for Coimbatore / STRICT_TARGET_LOCATIONS.
- Also harvest public buyer/demand ad signals (BUYER_SIGNAL_QUERIES) without inventing contacts.
- Instagram: NO login; only fields visible in Google/public preview cards (INSTAGRAM_DISCOVERY_RULE).
- Do NOT use Justdial/OLX as primary sources.
- EVERY saved contractor row MUST include Source Platform and Source Website.
- Lead rows store LEAD_SHEET_COLUMNS only — no pitch column.
- ALWAYS optimize Sheet1: dedupe on phone then name; phone-first ordering.
- DISCARD REJECT_CITY_HINTS; KEEP ALLOWED_CITY_HINTS / STRICT_TARGET_LOCATIONS / Coimbatore.
- Prefer rows WITH phone numbers; never invent digits.
- BROWSER scrape: chromium.launch(channel="chrome", headless=False) + fresh new_context; no launch_persistent_context ./chrome_profile.
- Geolocation auto-grant COIMBATORE_COORDINATES.
- Keep agents as SEPARATE modules; Vicky orchestrates.
- Phase 5 UI: JARVIS layout density + black/gold marble replacing blue/cyan zones; voice+text; phone+desktop; Vicky personality like JARVIS/FRIDAY.
- Email Agent drafts only — human approval required before any send.
- Do not ship Marketing/Email until Phase 2 website exists.
- Do not treat the current Streamlit workbench as the final product.
